        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion C2-0, Southwestern Stepped Scalloped Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade in the southwestern style, this Grade 2 deadbolt is crafted out of solid brass. It is available in antique copper, antique pewter, and brushed nickel finishes as either a single or a double cylinder deadbolt.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion C2 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion C2 Southwestern Stepped Scalloped Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-3/8\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder -  The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder - The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
