                "description": "Navajo Stepped Scalloped Deadbolt Fusion C2 - Made in the southwestern style, this grade 2 deadbolt is crafted out of solid brass. It is available in antique copper, antique pewter, and brushed nickel finishes as either a single or a double cylinder deadbolt. ",
